Subject: [PATCH] SOL: use physical UART in output-only mode

Hide the vUART selector and ignore old source query parameters. Attach
the terminal to the physical default endpoint with bidirectional forwarding
disabled and explain the read-only behavior to users.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD serial topology]

